<title>INDIA: India's RBI keeps repo auction cut-off at 3.6 pct.</title>
<headline>India's RBI keeps repo auction cut-off at 3.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said it maintained the cut-off rate at 3.6 percent at a repo auction on Thursday.  </p>
<p>The RBI said it received five bids for 44.50 billion rupees, all of which it accepted at a cut-off rate of 3.60 percent.</p>
<p>The weighted average cut-off rate was 3.5787 percent.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
